##
#
# Boundary condition validation with a modified isentropic vortex, Section
# 6.3, Table 4 of [1].
#
# The isentropic vortex of 2025-KMT-6.2-isentropic_vortex.prm (gamma = 5/3,
# beta = 5, x_0 = (-1, -1), domain [-5, 5]^2) is advected with velocity
# v_inf = (M, M), i.e., with speed sqrt(2) M in diagonal direction. The
# final time t = 6 / M is chosen such that the vortex is centered on the
# top right corner of the domain at final time. A large part of the outflow
# boundary is subsonic for M = 1 and M = 1.5.
#
# This file corresponds to strategy (b) of Table 4, sub/supersonic boundary
# conditions ("dynamic") with the exact solution as boundary data, for M =
# 1. For strategy (a) set all boundary conditions to "dirichlet". For M =
# 1.5, 2.0, 2.5 set the "mach number" to sqrt(2) M and the final time to 6
# / M. The rows of Table 4 are obtained by increasing "mesh refinement"
# from 0 to 5 (dG Q1, 24 elements per edge, 2304 degrees of freedom per
# component on level 0). As in 2025-KMT-6.2-isentropic_vortex.prm we use
# erk 54 instead of "SSPRK-54" and "relaxation factor = 4"; this is a
# reconstruction.
#
# The boundary conditions have been changed since the computations of [1]
# were done. The L1 errors are 2-9 times larger than in Table 4 and
# converge with rates 1.1-1.9 instead of 2.1-2.3 (levels 0-3).
#
# [1] M. Kronbichler, M. Maier, I. Tomas. Graph-based methods for
#     hyperbolic systems of conservation laws using discontinuous space
#     discretizations. Commun. Comput. Phys., 38:74-108, 2025.
#     arXiv:2402.04514
#
##

subsection A - Scheduler
  set basename          = isentropic_vortex-boundary_conditions

  set align time steps  = true

  set tasks             = error evaluation

  set final time        = 6.0
  set timer granularity = 6.0
end


subsection B - Equation
  set dimension = 2
  set equation  = euler
  set gamma     = 1.66666666666667
end


subsection C - Discretization
  set finite element ansatz = dG Q1

  set geometry              = rectangular domain
  set mesh refinement       = 0

  subsection rectangular domain
    set position bottom left      = -5, -5
    set position top right        =  5,  5
    set subdivisions x            = 24
    set subdivisions y            = 24

    set boundary condition bottom = dynamic
    set boundary condition left   = dynamic
    set boundary condition right  = dynamic
    set boundary condition top    = dynamic
  end
end


subsection E - InitialValues
  set configuration = isentropic vortex
  set direction     =  1,  1
  set position      = -1, -1

  subsection isentropic vortex
    set mach number = 1.41421356237310
    set beta        = 5
  end
end


subsection F - HyperbolicModule
  subsection limiter
    set relaxation factor = 4
  end
end


subsection H - TimeIntegrator
  set cfl min               = 0.50
  set cfl max               = 0.50
  set cfl recovery strategy = none
  set time stepping scheme  = erk 54
end


subsection K - ErrorEvaluation
  set error normalize  = true
  set error quantities = rho, m_1, m_2, E
end
